        "answer": {
          "short": "False.",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\sin(360^\\circ+\\theta)&=\\sin\\theta\\\\\\sin(180^\\circ+\\theta)&=-\\sin\\theta\\end{align*}$$\nThe two expressions are not generally equal.",
